From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:30:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): integrate local containment transaction custody
 [daveey]

Add inactive local-only lifecycle service with current run and graph scope checks, exact immutable release attestations, frozen in-flight producer baselines, atomic run end and spend-preserving release. Normalize append-owned causal envelopes and reset review recovery phase for both containment events. Synced ingress and public command registration remain disabled pending Board/courier integration; this commit is not delivery of the complete primitive.
